version:1
before:plan|audit|edit|debug|test|review|delegate|expensive-tool
load:CLAUDE.md>.ai/rules/00-master-rules.md>.ai/context/context-index.json>task-context
lock:objective,success,dod,scope,out
limits:wip=1,nest=3,retry=3,critic=2
discover:BLOCKER|required;REQUIRED|required;OPTIONAL|park;UNRELATED|park
evidence:repo-source|required
progress:requirement|blocker|deliverable|new-proof
recover:freeze>goal>evidence>shrink>new-strategy
verify:smallest-sufficient>mandatory-gates-once
communicate:1-5-lines,short,direct,concrete,visible
stop:dod-and-proof
